[{"title":"赠别谢大行友可社丈擢南北部 其六","author":"张萱","text":"秣陵关口草凄凄，古巷乌衣路不迷。\n君去定知携小陆，数椽秋色屋东西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18688,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别谢大行友可社丈擢南北部 其七","author":"张萱","text":"且将白眼撑高旻，莫向风尘叹积薪。\n薄宦亦须谙宦态，右文原自妒文人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18689,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别谢大行友可社丈擢南北部 其八","author":"张萱","text":"江空日落凤台寒，片片浮云好独看。\n为语当年李供奉，登台不必望长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18690,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺丁哲初吏部得雄 其一","author":"张萱","text":"王香入梦掌珠呈，高烛薇垣彻夜明。\n冰鉴独悬君自信，当筵不必试啼声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18691,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺丁哲初吏部得雄 其二","author":"张萱","text":"红云一孕照东曹，锦绂庭麟沸凤璈。\n抱得宁馨森片玉，阿爷原是玉山高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18692,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺丁哲初吏部得雄 其三","author":"张萱","text":"毰毸赤凤下青霄，桂馥兰芳紫气饶。\n月下将雏新奏曲，不须长教广陵箫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18693,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题杨曙宇寅丈竹梅馆 其一","author":"张萱","text":"君家三径未全荒，万个琅玕万斛香。\n林密似遮张廌屋，花飞不点寿阳妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18694,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题杨曙宇寅丈竹梅馆 其二","author":"张萱","text":"拂云梢畔雪初残，疏影清阴满画栏。\n万卷纵横帘不掷，玉奴长伴此君閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18695,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题杨曙宇寅丈竹梅馆 其三","author":"张萱","text":"苞金绽玉影交加，庾岭湘江寄兴赊。\n为报主人归未得，好留双影护窗纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18696,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题杨曙宇寅丈竹梅馆 其四","author":"张萱","text":"芳园遍植岁寒丛，结伴何须十八公。\n见说森森曾入梦，阶前原有两株松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18697,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏题邓给谏玄度梅花帐 其一","author":"张萱","text":"抛书摊饭鬓鬖鬖，酒殢花慵鼾正憨。\n长得玉奴供客枕，不须迢递梦江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18698,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏题邓给谏玄度梅花帐 其二","author":"张萱","text":"数幅冰绡玉一枝，薰笼斜倚月明时。\n纵教万斛天香满，不及吹灯来梦儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18699,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏题邓给谏玄度梅花帐 其三","author":"张萱","text":"缟衣舞罢梦初残，漫向春风忆