"notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18706,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东林石涧桥见独树梅花有感 其二","author":"张萱","text":"双旌日日破苍烟，无数梅花对客妍。\n更爱一枝临绿水，寒山影里玉娟娟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18707,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东林石涧桥见独树梅花有感 其三","author":"张萱","text":"疏篱寒傍石桥隈，不种莲花却种梅。\n久别罗浮山下月，清香何事扑人来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18708,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东林石涧桥见独树梅花有感 其四","author":"张萱","text":"几点寒葩万斛香，晴云片片护幽芳。\n野人不识春风面，独照溪流写淡妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18709,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小池驿喜晴","author":"张萱","text":"霁色初开趁碧蹄，雕鞍未解却频嘶。\n青骢亦识游人意，骤向春流洗障坭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18710,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北埉关公馆阅外计邸报有感 其一","author":"张萱","text":"北去汉京频极目，南来粤客独长吁。\n已惊鸾凤投罗网，又报豺狼到海隅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":18711,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北埉关公馆阅外计邸报有感 其二","author":"张萱","text":"徂父赋徂何足较，马翁失马不须悲。\n一言未悟田丞相，三黜休嗟鲁士师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"rep